    "detailed_description": "Help the hero get out of limbo. Get to level 25 and learn its history.<br>Jump on the platforms. Beware of shurikens and shoot the activators. Search the level for the entrance to the next level, but be careful! Platforms are destructible - do not make unnecessary movements!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One life of the character: a collision with a shuriken or a fall into the abyss.<br></li><li>Automatic shot in the direction of the character's movement.<br></li><li>Several activators on the level that you need to shoot to open the door to the next level.<br></li><li>Destructible platforms from the shots.<br></li><li>Changing the shape of the character-changes the mechanics of interaction with the game world:<br>    - Changes the speed and distance of the bullet.<br>    - Changes the height of the jump and the speed of movement of the character.<br></li><li>A basic jump of normal shape and two more ways to jump higher.<br>    - The highest jump will require a certain amount of dexterity and pulling out the timing.<br></li><li>A zone for permanent retention of the small form of the character.<br></li><li>Traps in the form of shuriken with physical properties.<br></li><li>On the levels there are areas of darkness or completely night levels.</li></ul>",
